  "title": "Peer-Relative Returns",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "504255ae-74b2-47e7-8445-1e79bd2cebf4",
      "question": "Among the 50 most liquid US stocks, which five beat the group's average return by the most, and which five trailed it by the most, over the 20 trading sessions ending March 12, 2026?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-01T21:41:40.180646Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-01T21:41:52.304390Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "**Top 5 — beat the group average by the most** (peer-relative return over 20 sessions ending 2026-03-12)\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Peer-relative return |\n|------|--------|----------------------|\n| 1 | CRCL | +98.9% |\n| 2 | COIN | +28.4% |\n| 3 | NFLX | +19.8% |\n| 4 | CRM  | +8.9% |\n| 5 | CRWD | +7.7% |\n\n**Bottom 5 — trailed the group average by the most**\n\n| Rank | Ticker | Peer-relative return |\n|------|--------|----------------------|\n| 1 | BABA | –17.0% |\n| 2 | GS   | –15.1% |\n| 3 | CRWV | –14.6% |\n| 4 | TXN  | –14.4% |\n| 5 | WFC  | –13.9% |\n\n*Peer-relative return = asset’s return minus the mean return of the 50 most liquid stocks. Values are fractions converted to percentages. Window: 20 trading sessions ending 2026-03-12.* [1][2]\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:5f7ff490a8cd5458cdb0b6b45012932c2dc8197290ae6108763a59a9dc41d84d`\n- [2] Market analytics result — market scan — evidence `hermes-receipt:942204e76ff9ec81e1070f423f97dff5c458ecae408a4ab75d145a1231db940c`",
